HIV/AIDS in the Americas</article-title><source>PAHO Working Group Summary Report</source><year>2000</year><publisher-name>Cancun, Mexico: PAHO/WHO, UNAIDS, IAPAC</publisher-name><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>11</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>World Health Organization</collab></person-group><article-title>Standards For Quality HIV Care: A Tool For Quality Assessment, Improvement, And Accreditation</article-title><source>Consultation Meeting on the Accreditation of Health Service Facilities for HIV Care, Geneva, Switzerland</source><year>2004</year></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Brook</surname><given-names>RH</given-names></name><name><surname>Mcglynn</surname><given-names>EA</given-names></name><name><surname>Shekelle</surname><given-names>PG</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Defining and measuring quality of care: a perspective from US researchers</article-title><source>International Journal for Quality in Health Care</source><year>2000</year><volume>12</volume><fpage>281</fpage><lpage>295</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10985266</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1093/intqhc/12.4.281</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hecht</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Wilson</surname><given-names>IB</given-names></name><name><surname>Wu</surname><given-names>AW</given-names></name><name><surname>Cook</surname><given-names>RL</given-names></name><name><surname>Turner</surname><given-names>BJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Optimizing care for person with HIV Infection</article-title><source>Annals of Internal Medicine</source><year>1999</year><volume>131</volume><fpage>136</fpage><lpage>143</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10419430</pub-id></citation></ref